~ sign
do disable_movement()
Sign: OLD RIDGE ROAD — CLOSED. NO WAY THROUGH. DO NOT CLEAR IT.
Someone has scratched three short notches under the last line, one below the other.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ barricade
do disable_movement()
Rails lashed across the road, built to last. Beyond them the trees close up completely.
do enable_movement()
=> END
